Filter
├── output columns: [win_narrow_vc.v['a']['x']::Float32 (#5), row_number() OVER (PARTITION BY v:a:k ORDER BY v:t DESC) (#4)]
├── filters: [row_number() OVER (PARTITION BY v:a:k ORDER BY v:t DESC) (#4) = 1]
├── estimated rows: 1.00
└── Window
    ├── output columns: [win_narrow_vc.v['a']['k'] (#2), win_narrow_vc.v['t'] (#3), win_narrow_vc.v['a']['x']::Float32 (#5), row_number() OVER (PARTITION BY v:a:k ORDER BY v:t DESC) (#4)]
    ├── aggregate function: [row_number]
    ├── partition by: [v['a']['k']]
    ├── order by: [v['t']]
